y","summary":"Bulk invitations set the token and token_expires_at through the helper. Removed the unused uuid import."},{"path":"taiga/projects/api.py","summary":"pre_save sets the token through the helper. resend_invitation rotates the token before it sends the email. InvitationViewSet.get_queryset only returns invitations that have not expired."},{"path":"taiga/projects/validators.py","summary":"token and token_expires_at are now read-only in MembershipValidator."},{"path":"taiga/export_import/services/store.py","summary":"Imported memberships get the token and expiration date from the helper. Removed the unused uuid import."},{"path":"taiga/projects/management/commands/sample_data.py","summary":"Sample invitations use the helper, so they have a valid expiration date."},{"path":"tests/factories.py","summary":"MembershipFactory and InvitationFactory set token_expires_at to now + 7 days."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_memberships.py","summary":"Tests for: the helper, create and bulk create setting the expiration date (client values are ignored), resend changing the token (old link 404, new link 200), and GET by token for a valid, an expired and an old token."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_auth.py","summary":"Tests that login and private register reject expired and old invitation tokens with 404 and accept nothing. Added a test that private register works with a valid invitation."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_importer_api.py","summary":"Test that an imported invitation gets a token valid for one week and that an expiration date in the import data is ignored."},{"path":"docs/harness/log.md","summary":"Added a 2026-11-02 entry for this change."}],"acceptance":[{"criterion":"Expired and legacy invitation tokens are rejected everywhere (GET invitation, login, register)","met":true,"evidence":"test_get_invitation_by_expired_or_legacy_token_returns_404, test_get_auth_token_with_expired_or_legacy_invitation_is_rejected and test_private_register_with_expired_or_leg