{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgd58wbHFN7F9izARkT75","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The full suite has now finished: 1752 of 1761 tests passed and 9 failed. The 9 failures are not caused by the invitation change.\n\n- **The failures:** all 9 are logo and avatar upload tests (`test_change_avatar`, `test_update_project_logo`, `test_valid_dump_import_with_logo` and similar). Each one fails because an uploaded file is missing on disk.\n- **Why they look unrelated:** I reran those same 9 tests on their own and they all passed. They only fail inside the long full run, so it is probably a test-isolation problem around the media files.\n\nThe other checks are unchanged: the 155 tests in the three related files pass and `make check-fast` passes (238 tests).\n\nThis answer is newer than the JSON I sent earlier, which still says the full-suite result was pending. With this result, the only open item is the 9 upload-test failures. Someone should run them again in a clean environment, or in CI, to confirm they fail without this change too.\n\nThe two questions in the JSON are still open: whether old pending invitations need a grace period when this is deployed, and whether it is acceptable that API clients can no longer set `token` or `token_expires_at`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":86980,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":210},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cec24dfb-4328-4cb7-84dc-3c0d114a7488","uuid":"3ef779fe-231d-4da8-97dc-b95006f0dfc5","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:25:37.328Z","request_id":"req_011Cgd58wMQSJAjiWmnwWDXC"}
