 Before deploy, note that pending invitations already in real databases have no expiration date, so they stop working; admins must resend them.","changes":[{"path":"settings/common.py","summary":"Add INVITATION_TOKEN_LIFETIME = timedelta(days=7)."},{"path":"taiga/projects/services/invitations.py","summary":"Add generate_invitation_token(), set_invitation_token() and valid_invitations_filter(); get_membership_by_token rejects expired and legacy tokens."},{"path":"taiga/projects/services/__init__.py","summary":"Export the new invitation helpers."},{"path":"taiga/projects/services/members.py","summary":"Bulk invitations get their token and expiration date from the helper; remove the uuid import."},{"path":"taiga/projects/api.py","summary":"pre_save uses set_invitation_token; resend_invitation rotates the token and its expiration date and saves them; InvitationViewSet.get_queryset only returns valid invitations (404 otherwise)."},{"path":"taiga/export_import/services/store.py","summary":"Imported memberships get their token and expiration date from the helper; remove the uuid import."},{"path":"taiga/projects/management/commands/sample_data.py","summary":"Sample invitations use generate_invitation_token()."},{"path":"tests/factories.py","summary":"MembershipFactory and InvitationFactory set token_expires_at to now + 7 days."},{"path":"tests/integration/test_invitation_token_expiration.py","summary":"New: 17 tests for issuing (helper, API create, bulk create, import, factories), GET by token, login and private register with valid, expired and legacy tokens, and resend rotation."},{"path":"docs/harness/log.md","summary":"Add a 2026-11-02 entry: what changed, the shared test DB problem and its workaround, what is left."}],"acceptance":[{"criterion":"Expired and legacy invitation tokens are rejected everywhere","met":true,"evidence":"Parametrized tests for GET /invitations/<token>, login with invitation_token and private register all return 404 for expired and legacy tokens